{"v":4,"catch":"RALF和CLARK爆炸了他們的IKARI！體驗激烈的戰鬥！","desc":"“IKARI III -THE RESCUE-”是SNK在1989年發布的動作射擊遊戲。\n玩家扮演精銳士兵RALF和CLARK的角色，並滲透到恐怖分子基地，以營救被劫持為人質的總統候選人的兒子。\n不要花太長時間營救人質，否則主要恐怖勢力就會追趕他們。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-03-26","genres":["射擊","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34c6ebe781a6e4c922cf97e499b301fdd4933bb80e99a9bc558f8b636023dbcc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7636ba32052a520ef5125d8fcd534173db21378b330593976c53c0543229e40.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/39c87d048d523761a8fded1b3ee24dbe99e0b99ef1af72ea6dd5fbda591bb25e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb1dace7e629514621b3c49685d0cb9e7b32d4330fdd6b10ad53dad5530dce3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e28ee9f83b3ee71afebdb8f999e2955e71578afbee7a81a4393e2d2ea7c12cb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5d3ccf32ef2333e3591bc9a708ee51af476a87b0e7ceed04cc425157e90d88f.jpg"],"titleId":"01004b1010e58000","dlc":[]}